  "titleText": {
    "es": "",
    "en": "Ma'am, I admit that wasn't in the best taste, but you have to admire my delivery! Ha ha, get it? Oh God, don't throw those syringes! Your baby's fine!",
    "noteEn": "The Spanish archive leaves the title text empty. The official English text extends the birth-delivery pun through the doctor's joke delivery, then has him reassure the angry mother."
